// Program metadata for nvim.
//
// kind=user → installed by the profile runner inside the chroot as the owning
// user via paru. The hand-rolled Neovim config (home/) is applied by the
// Runner's Config Apply pass (ADR 0134); install.sh installs the editor
// toolchain only. The neovim binary itself stays in Host Core packages.editors
// (this program's name "nvim" does not collide with the "neovim" package, so
// exclusivity ADR 0115 does not force it out). The LSP/formatter toolchain is
// declared in Host Core language-servers as bare packages (editor-agnostic, no
// mason — ADR 0135); this program stages the config and installs only the
// best-effort Swift toolchain (AUR swift-bin, guarded). Static default look is
// Catppuccin Mocha with a sapphire accent, follow_noctalia off by default
// (ADR 0136).

{
  "name": "nvim",
  "kind": "user",
  "description": "Hand-rolled Neovim (lazy.nvim) + LSP toolchain."
}
